# Forms

- Use `@tanstack/react-form` for form state.
- Keep Zod schemas colocated with the mutation or auth module that owns the payload.
- Prefer the shadcn field primitives from `@/components/ui/field`.
- Inside each `form.Field`, compute `const isInvalid = field.state.meta.isTouched && !field.state.meta.isValid` once and reuse it for `data-invalid`, `aria-invalid`, and `FieldError`.
- Keep `useForm({ onSubmit })` focused on orchestration; move side effects into per-call mutation handlers unless the same success behavior must run for every call site.
- If a component must guarantee a success effect even when it may unmount mid-flight, lift the effect to the mutation hook or derive UI from mutation state.
- Avoid mixing unrelated field layouts in the same file.
